  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leveraging Investor Influence to Address Deforestation with a particular focus on Indonesia and Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will seek to move companies to implement their commitments for deforestation-free supply chains. This will be done by influencing the two key target groups, namely institutional investors and companies driving deforestation (palm oil, beef, soy, and cocoa to be included).</narrative>
  </description>
